// - Handle/record unattributed packets when current task is not meaningful.
// - Add cgroup id / socket cookie correlation if available/useful.
// - Consider per-CPU maps + userspace aggregation for performance.
// - Define attach target (root cgroup vs specific cgroups) and namespace behavior.
// - Add ringbuf/perf events only if needed; polling hash map may suffice for first prototype.
